      "message": "[error] Line 401: 🔴 `metadata.toNativeFromUtf8()` is now executed inside `snapshotConversationCallback { ... }`, which defers execution. `metadata` comes from the daemon callback boundary and may not be valid after the callback returns, so this can read invalid/native-freed data or produce corrupted request metadata. Convert the map before scheduling (e.g., `val decoded \u003d metadata.toNativeFromUtf8(); snapshotConversationCallback { mAccountService.conversationRequestReceived(accountId, conversationId, decoded) }`).",
